= Ernst Meyer

A Spartacist of the first hour, a journalist from East Prussia with a weak chest and a steady temper. [? if march_action = 1 : After the defeat of March 1921, the party turned to him to put the pieces back together. ?][? if march_action != 1 : He is the man the party sends for when the currents stop speaking to each other. ?]

- @consolidate
