- @root: Return to main

@consolidate
title: Rebuild the Organisation
subtitle: Patient work in every district.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 4;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] += 4;
}
Q.unity += 5;
!}

Meyer visits the districts one by one. He reopens the offices that were closed and pays the printers who were not paid. Nobody cheers.

@centre
title: Steer Between Left and Right
subtitle: Both wings get something. Each suspects the other got more.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 4;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 6;
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 6;
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction -= 3;
!}

Meyer writes a resolution that Ruth Fischer and Heinrich Brandler can both vote for. It says very little, very carefully.
